Edge: if p is empty, path.resolve(dataDir, '') returns dataDir itself. I already check empty.

Also what about `path` being `.` - resolved === dataDir, which is the check `resolved !== dataDir`. Then it would pass traversal but fs.stat would be a directory, not isFile, so reject. Good.

